---
import Legal from '../layouts/Legal.astro';
---

<Legal
  title="Refund Policy"
  description="Refund policy for Hosted openagent.email one-time purchases."
>
  <h1>Refund Policy</h1>
  <p class="updated">Last updated: August 24, 2026</p>
  <p class="lede">Hosted Pro is a one-time purchase, currently waitlist. Public checkout is not open.</p>
  <p>
    When checkout opens and a hosted instance is provisioned for an order, payments are generally
    non-refundable once provisioning has started.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you are later charged in error, experience a duplicate charge, or cannot use the service because
    of a fault on our side, contact us within 14 days of purchase.
  </p>
  <p>
    To request help after a purchase, include the email used on the order.
  </p>
  <p>
    Payment: When checkout opens, Alipay will be the available method. We do not offer credit-card or
    Apple Pay checkout.
  </p>
</Legal>
